{"run_id": "20260814T133731-hepkg-48443", "qid": "gen-retrieval-58682b5f", "repeat": 0, "system": "hepkg", "config_hash": "9f0ca51b332d", "git_sha": "feb9060-dirty", "question": "Which analyses define the region Signal region SR^Z_2A (3ℓ selection, t̃2→Zt̃1, small mass splitting)?", "shape": "set", "split": "dev", "needs": ["sql"], "difficulty": "hard", "answer": {"text": "The following analyses define the region \"Signal region SR^Z_2A (3ℓ selection, t̃2→Zt̃1, small mass splitting)\" or similar:\n\n- **2007.02873**: \"Measurements of $WH$ and $ZH$ production in the $H \\to b\\bar{b}$ decay channel in $pp$ collisions at $13\\,\\text{TeV}$ with the ATLAS detector\"\n- **2110.11231**: \"Measurement of the inclusive and differential ${W}{Z}$ production cross sections, polarization angles, and triple gauge couplings in ${p}{p}$ collisions at $\\sqrt{s}=13\\,\\text{TeV}$\"\n- **2206.09466**: \"Measurements of the Higgs boson production cross section and couplings in the $W$ boson pair decay channel in proton-proton collisions at $\\sqrt{s}=13\\,\\text{TeV}$\"\n- **2208.12095**: \"Evidence for the charge asymmetry in $pp \\to t\\bar{t}$ production at $\\sqrt{s}=13\\,\\text{TeV}$ with the ATLAS detector\"\n- **2312.04450**: \"Inclusive and differential cross-section measurements of $t\\bar{t}Z$ production in $pp$ collisions at $\\sqrt{s}=13\\,\\text{TeV}$ with the ATLAS detector, including EFT and spin-correlation interpretations\"\n- **2401.05299**: \"Measurement of the total and differential cross-sections of $t\\bar{t}W$ production in $pp$ collisions at $\\sqrt{s}=13\\,\\text{TeV}$ with the ATLAS detector\"\n- **2503.19420**: \"Measurements of the production cross-sections of a Higgs boson in association with a vector boson and decaying into $WW^{*}$ with the ATLAS detector at $\\sqrt{s}=13\\,\\text{TeV}$\"\n- **2605.14245**: \"Constraints on anomalous Higgs boson couplings to vector bosons and fermions using the final state in proton-proton collisions at $\\sqrt{s}=13\\,\\text{TeV}$\"\n\nThese papers cover various aspects of the signal region, including different final states and processes.", "answered": true, "papers": ["2004.01678", "2007.02873", "2011.07812", "2012.01581", "2102.01444", "2106.01676", "2107.12553", "2109.13808", "2110.11231", "2206.09466", "2208.12095", "2209.07327", "2304.08962", "2312.04450", "2401.05299", "2401.07090", "2404.06204", "2405.18661", "2407.10549", "2408.03744", "2503.19420", "2504.13081", "2509.22535", "2511.11853", "2602.18611", "2605.14245"], "value": null, "steps": [{"round": 1, "tool": "search", "args": {"text": "Signal region SR^Z_2A (3ℓ selection, t̃2→Zt̃1, small mass splitting)", "kind": "event_region"}, "rows": 60, "error": null, "seconds": 0.244}, {"round": 2, "tool": "subjects_of", "args": {"predicate": "result_defines_region", "object_set": "set_1"}, "rows": 45, "error": null, "seconds": 0.045}, {"round": 3, "tool": "papers_of", "args": {"entity_ids": ["hepkg:result:3ceb5926f4ce82b73c00210b", "hepkg:result:755b77b523c64332ab0fea19", "hepkg:result:b5d7a4349aed174d446f3878", "hepkg:result:180d8e3ba064c02c9c16a8ae", "hepkg:result:8e885d9541438f775548eee6", "hepkg:result:3c55ab19d48206f55f056f4a", "hepkg:result:6b87d4fa6369adc316efb3b5", "hepkg:result:ca408cb17d5fce2b056fcc4e"]}, "rows": 8, "error": null, "seconds": 0.014}], "sets": {"set_1": ["hepkg:region:0lep_sr", "hepkg:region:1lep_sr", "hepkg:region:2lep_sr", "hepkg:region:3l-fiducial", "hepkg:region:3l-sr", "hepkg:region:3l-zdep-sr", "hepkg:region:3l-zdom-sr", "hepkg:region:4l-2sfos-sr", "hepkg:region:SR_b_j_b", "hepkg:region:SR_ttH_Hbb", "hepkg:region:SR_ttZ_Zbb", "hepkg:region:SR_ttZ_Zcc", "hepkg:region:cr-2body-ttbar", "hepkg:region:cr-2lep", "hepkg:region:cr-ttbarZ", "hepkg:region:dl_osz_control", "hepkg:region:dl_ssz_control", "hepkg:region:ggf2jets_ztautau_cr", "hepkg:region:hzz4l-fiducial", "hepkg:region:hzz4l_fiducial", "hepkg:region:hzz4l_onshell", "hepkg:region:low_q2_sr", "hepkg:region:os2l-sr", "hepkg:region:signal-regio