prehensive constraints on various anomalous couplings from the \\( M(WZ) \\) tail.\n\n<tool_call>\n{\"name\": \"answer\", \"arguments\": {\"text\": \"The analysis that measured the Anomalous coupling \\( c_w/\\\\Lambda^2 \\\\) constraint from the \\( M(WZ) \\\\) tail is reported in the paper with arXiv ID [2110.11231](https://arxiv.org/abs/2110.11231). This analysis includes the following key details:\\n- **Systematic Uncertainties**: Full set of Section 7 systematic uncertainties included as nuisance parameters.\\n- **Observables Measured**:\\n  - \\( c_w/\\\\Lambda^2 \\\\) constraint from \\( M(WZ) \\\\) tail\\n  - \\( c_{www}/\\\\Lambda^2 \\\\) constraint from \\( M(WZ) \\\\) tail\\n  - \\( c_b/\\\\Lambda^2 \\\\) constraint from \\( M(WZ) \\\\) tail\\n  - CP-violating \\( c_{\\\\tilde{www}}/\\\\Lambda", "answered": true, "papers": ["2106.01676", "2109.13808", "2110.11231", "2205.05120", "2401.05299", "2405.18661", "2509.22535", "2602.18611", "2605.14245"], "value": null, "steps": [{"round": 1, "tool": "search", "args": {"text": "Anomalous coupling c_w/Lambda^2 constraint from M(WZ) tail", "kind": "result"}, "rows": 27, "error": null, "seconds": 0.187}, {"round": 2, "tool": "papers_of", "args": {"entity_ids": ["hepkg:result:atgc-search"]}, "rows": 1, "error": null, "seconds": 0.008}, {"round": 3, "tool": "describe", "args": {"entity_ids": ["hepkg:result:atgc-search"]}, "rows": 13, "error": null, "seconds": 0.014}], "sets": {"set_1": ["hepkg:result:2hdm_hmssm_exclusion", "hepkg:result:3ceb5926f4ce82b73c00210b", "hepkg:result:52d0213216b446bc782fa4dc", "hepkg:result:5a41a7c7c62ceaef4c046044", "hepkg:result:accepteff-offwz-dm20", "hepkg:result:accepteff-offwz-dm60", "hepkg:result:atgc-search", "hepkg:result:coupling_effective_binv_kv1", "hepkg:result:coupling_effective_bsm0", "hepkg:result:coupling_resolved", "hepkg:result:excl-higgsino-dm30-60", "hepkg:result:excl-winobinominus-dm80", "hepkg:result:excl-winobinoplus-offwz-dm20-35", "hepkg:result:excl-winobinoplus-of