{"run_id": "20260814T133731-hepkg-48443", "qid": "gen-retrieval-5c5c2234", "repeat": 0, "system": "hepkg", "config_hash": "9f0ca51b332d", "git_sha": "feb9060-dirty", "question": "Which analyses define a region requiring Missing transverse momentum?", "shape": "set", "split": "dev", "needs": ["sql"], "difficulty": "hard", "answer": {"text": "The following analyses define a region requiring Missing transverse momentum:\n\n- **2004.01678**: Preselection region (m_llj < 250 GeV)\n- **2006.05880**: Control regions CR^Z_ttZ and CR^Z_VV for multi-boson and ttZ background normalisation (3ℓ selection)\n- **2007.02873**: 0-lepton channel signal region (SR)\n- **2009.14537**: Preselection region (opposite-charge same-flavor dilepton, Z-veto, low p_T^ll)\n- **2012.01581**: Common dijet/SV preselection region (Table 2) and Final signal region (Region H)\n- **2106.01676**: On-shell WZ selection signal regions (SR^WZ)\n- **2106.14246**: 2ℓSS search regions (SS01–SS20) and Common baseline selection for three-lepton categories (3ℓA–3ℓF)\n- **2107.12553**: Baseline preselection common to all signal regions (Table 6) and 12 non-overlapping signal regions categorized in N_H, N_jets, p_T^miss (Table 8)\n- **2110.11231**: Signal region (SR) for WZ trilepton production\n- **2112.00895**: SL channel selection, W->e nu decay (reconstructed) and SL channel selection, W->mu nu decay (reconstructed)\n- **2112.03161**: Dilepton (DL) channel signal region\n- **2209.07327**: Multilepton channel signal region\n- **2304.08962**: Signal region (SR): tight vertex, m4mu<11 GeV, ΔR<0.25\n- **2312.04450**: SR-2ℓ-5j2b\n- **2401.05299**: 2ℓ SS Signal Region\n- **2402.08486**: Detector-level dilepton ttbar signal region (baseline event selection) and Detector-level extra-jet definition region for N_jet measurement\n- **2404.06204**: Detector-level signal region for W -> e nu selection and Detector-level signal region for W -> mu nu selection\n\nThese analyses cover a variety of processes and final states, 