{"run_id": "20260814T133731-hepkg-48443", "qid": "gen-retrieval-5f0e12f3", "repeat": 0, "system": "hepkg", "config_hash": "9f0ca51b332d", "git_sha": "feb9060-dirty", "question": "Which analyses estimate the background $WW$ background?", "shape": "set", "split": "dev", "needs": ["sql"], "difficulty": "hard", "answer": {"text": "The following analyses estimate the $WW$ background:\n\n- **2007.02873**: \"Measurements of $WH$ and $ZH$ production in the $H \\rightarrow b\\bar{b}$ decay channel in $pp$ collisions at $13\\, \\text{TeV}$ with the ATLAS detector\"\n- **2202.08676**: \"Inclusive nonresonant multilepton probes of new phenomena at $\\sqrt{s}=13\\, \\text{TeV}$\"\n- **2206.09466**: \"Measurements of the Higgs boson production cross section and couplings in the $W$ boson pair decay channel in proton-proton collisions at $\\sqrt{s}=13\\, \\text{TeV}$\"\n- **2208.12095**: \"Evidence for the charge asymmetry in $pp \\rightarrow t\\bar{t}$ production at $\\sqrt{s}=13\\, \\text{TeV}$ with the ATLAS detector\"\n- **2308.02285**: \"Measurement of the production cross section for a $W$ boson in association with a charm quark in proton-proton collisions at $\\sqrt{s}=13\\, \\text{TeV}$\"\n- **2312.04450**: \"Inclusive and differential cross-section measurements of $t\\bar{t}Z$ production in $pp$ collisions at $\\sqrt{s}=13\\, \\text{TeV}$ with the ATLAS detector, including EFT and spin-correlation interpretations\"\n- **2401.05299**: \"Measurement of the total and differential cross-sections of $t\\bar{t}W$ production in $pp$ collisions at $\\sqrt{s}=13\\, \\text{TeV}$ with the ATLAS detector\"\n- **2404.06204**: \"Precise measurements of $W$ - and $Z$ -boson transverse momentum spectra with the ATLAS detector using $pp$ collisions at $\\sqrt{s}=5.02\\, \\text{TeV}$ and $13\\, \\text{TeV}$\"\n- **2408.03744**: \"Measurement of the inclusive cross sections for $W$ and $Z$ boson production in proton-proton collisions at $\\sqrt{s}=5.02$ and $13\\, \\text{TeV}$\"\n- **2503.19420**: \"Measurements of the production cross-sections of a Higgs boson in association with a vector boson and decaying into $WW^{\\ast}$ with the ATLAS detector at $\\sqrt{s}=13\\, \\text{TeV}$\"\n- **2604.21670**: \"Effective field theory interpretation of ATLAS measurements involving the Higgs boson, electroweak bosons and the top quark\"\n- **2604.27044**: \"Improved results on Higgs boson pair production in the 4 $b$ final state\"\n\nThese papers cover a range of analyses involving the estimation of the $WW$ background.", "answered": true, "papers": ["2004.14060", "2007.02873", "2010.14293", "2012.03799", "2012.08600", "2102.01444", "2106.01676", "2107.12553", "2109.13808", "2112.03161", "2202.08676", "2206.09466", "2208.12095", "2211.08028", "2302.05225", "2308.02285", "2312.04450", "2401.05299", "2404.06204", "2408.03744", "2503.19420", "2506.13565", "2511.11853", "2604.21670", "2604.27044"], "value": null, "steps": [{"round": 1, "tool": "search", "args": {"text": "WW", "kind": "background"}, "rows": 25, "error": null, "seconds": 0.104}, {"round": 2, "tool": "subjects_of", "args": {"predicate": "result_estimates_background", "object_set": "set_1"}, "rows": 55, "error": null, "seconds": 0.05}, {"round": 3, "tool": "papers_of", "args": {"entity_ids": ["hepkg:result:4a162a98ce57274854442b0f", "hepkg:result:755b77b523c64332ab0fea19", "hepkg:result:c56b160307f064d9155ebd77", "hepkg:result:b5d7a4349aed174d446f3878", "hepkg:result:c2a8c6c321f85ca4e9620c78", "hepkg:result:dbe00b660bc7b95a46e94404", "hepkg:result:c223e8afe1e53690005d65ee", "hepkg:result:8e885d9541438f775548eee6", "hepkg:result:3c55ab19d48206f55f056f4a", "hepkg:result:6b87d4fa6369adc316efb3b5", "hepkg:result:ca408cb17d5fce2b056fcc4e", "hepkg:result:ed295e954b4df9d734d7c339"]}, "rows": 12, "error": null, "seconds": 0.011}], "sets": {"set_1": ["hepkg:background:Wt", "hepkg:background:diboson", "hepkg:background:diboson-vv", "hepkg:background:diboson_background", "hepkg:background:diboson_nonww", "hepkg: