rix-element uncertainty), the $t\\bar{t}W$ and $t\\bar{t}Z$ MadGraph5_aMC@NLO+Pythia 8.210 samples, and the $t\\bar{t}H$ MadGraph5_aMC@NLO sample.\n11. **2401.05299**: This paper uses the generator MadGraph5_aMC@NLO for the $t\\bar{t}t\\bar{t}$ sample (MG5_aMC NLO + Pythia 8), the $t\\bar{t}WW, WtZ, t\\bar{t}t, tHjb, WtH$ sample (MG5_aMC LO + Pythia 8), and the $tZ$ sample (MG5_aMC LO + Pythia 8).\n12. **2503.19420**: This paper uses the generator MadGraph5_aMC@", "answered": true, "papers": ["2001.06899", "2004.04545", "2004.14060", "2006.05880", "2007.02873", "2009.04363", "2009.14537", "2011.07812", "2012.03799", "2012.08600", "2102.01444", "2103.04956", "2103.06956", "2106.01676", "2106.14246", "2107.12553", "2109.13808", "2110.11231", "2112.00895", "2112.03161", "2202.08676", "2205.05120", "2206.09466", "2207.00348", "2208.12095", "2209.07327", "2211.08028", "2303.15340", "2304.08962", "2307.01094", "2308.02285", "2309.14442", "2401.05299", "2401.07090", "2402.08486", "2403.01556", "2404.06204", "2405.18661", "2408.03744", "2503.19420", "2504.13081", "2506.13565", "2508.13900", "2509.22535", "2510.07527", "2511.11853", "2602.18611", "2604.21670", "2604.27044", "2605.14245"], "value": null, "steps": [{"round": 1, "tool": "search", "args": {"text": "Comix", "kind": "generator"}, "rows": 11, "error": null, "seconds": 0.08}, {"round": 2, "tool": "subjects_of", "args": {"predicate": "sample_uses_generator", "object_set": "set_1"}, "rows": 178, "error": null, "seconds": 0.061}, {"round": 3, "tool": "papers_of", "args": {"entity_ids": ["hepkg:sample:vvv", "hepkg:sample:zjets", "hepkg:sample:qq-wh", "hepkg:sample:qq-zh", "hepkg:sample:tWZ_tZ_madgraph", "hepkg:sample:twz", "hepkg:sample:tz-mg5", "hepkg:sample:tz", "hepkg:sample:tZ-tttt-ttt-mc", "hepkg:sample:ttbar_mg5_amcnlo_pythia8", "hepkg:sample:ttbar", "hepkg:sample:ttbarV-mc", "hepkg:sample:tth_mg5_amcnlo", "hepkg:sample:ttV_madgraph", "hepkg:sample:ttv", "hepkg:sample:ttW", "hepkg:sample:ttw_ttz_mg5_pythia8210", "