{"run_id": "20260814T133731-hepkg-48443", "qid": "gen-retrieval-61049ed3", "repeat": 0, "system": "hepkg", "config_hash": "9f0ca51b332d", "git_sha": "feb9060-dirty", "question": "Which analyses used the sample dRPV top squark (t~ -> dbar dbar) signal MC sample?", "shape": "set", "split": "dev", "needs": ["sql"], "difficulty": "hard", "answer": {"text": "The following analyses used the sample \"dRPV top squark (t~ -> dbar dbar) signal MC sample\":\n\n- **2009.04363**: Evidence for Higgs boson decay to a pair of muons\n- **2111.08340**: Constraints on Higgs boson production with large transverse momentum using \\( H \\rightarrow b\\bar{b} \\) decays in the ATLAS detector\n- **2202.08676**: Inclusive nonresonant multilepton probes of new phenomena at \\( \\sqrt{s}=13\\, \\text{TeV} \\)\n- **2205.05120**: Constraints on anomalous Higgs boson couplings to vector bosons and fermions from the production of Higgs bosons using the final state\n- **2208.12095**: Evidence for the charge asymmetry in \\( pp \\rightarrow t\\bar{t} \\) production at \\( \\sqrt{s}=13 \\) TeV with the ATLAS detector\n- **2303.15340**: Inclusive and differential cross-sections for dilepton \\( t\\bar{t} \\) production measured in \\( \\sqrt{s}=13 \\) TeV \\( pp \\) collisions with the ATLAS detector\n- **2309.14442**: Inclusive and differential cross section measurements of \\( t\\bar{t}b\\bar{b} \\) production in the lepton+jets channel at \\( \\sqrt{s}=13 \\) TeV\n- **2312.04450**: Inclusive and differential cross-section measurements of \\( t\\bar{t}Z \\) production in \\( pp \\) collisions at \\( \\sqrt{s}=13 \\) TeV with the ATLAS detector, including EFT and spin-correlation interpretations\n- **2508.13900**: General search for supersymmetric particles in scenarios with compressed mass spectra using proton-proton collisions at \\( \\sqrt{s}=13 \\) TeV\n- **2604.21670**: Effective field theory interpretation of ATLAS measurements involving the Higgs boson, electroweak bosons, and the top quark\n- **2604.27044**: Improved results on Higgs boson pair production in the 4 \\( b \\) final state\n\nHowever, it is important to note that the specific sample \"dRPV top squark (t~ -> dbar dbar) signal MC sample\" was not explicitly mentioned in the results. The results include various top quark and single-top samples, but not specifically the dRPV top squark sample. If you need more precise information, you might need to refine the search or check the specific details of each paper.\n\n<tool_call>\n{\"name\": \"answer\", \"arguments\": {\"text\": \"The following analyses used the sample 'dRPV top squark (t~ -> dbar dbar) signal MC sample':\\n\\n- **2009.04363**: Evidence for Higgs boson decay to a pair of muons\\n- **2111.08340**: Constraints on Higgs boson production with large transverse momentum using \\( H \\\\rightarrow b\\\\bar{b} \\\\) decays in the ATLAS detector\\n- **2202.08676**: Inclusive nonresonant multilepton probes of new phenomena at \\( \\\\sqrt{s}=13\\\\, \\\\text{TeV} \\\\)\\n- **2205.05120**: Constraints on anomalous Higgs boson", "answered": true, "papers": ["2001.06899", "2004.01678", "2004.14060", "2006.05880", "2007.02873", "2009.04363", "2010.14293", "2012.01581", "2012.03799", "2012.08600", "2102.01444", "2103.04956", "2106.01676", "2107.12553", "2109.13808", "2111.08340", "2112.03161", "2202.08676", "2205.05120", "2206.09466", "2208.12095", "2209.07327", "2211.08028", "2302.05225", "2303.15340", "2307.01094", "2308.02285", "2309.14442", "2312.04450", "2401.05299", "2402.08486", "2407.10549", "2408.03744", "2503.19420", "2506.13565", "2508.13900", "2509.22535", "2511.11853", "2604.21670", "2604.27044"], "value": null, "steps": [{"round": 1, "tool": "search", "args": {"text": "dRPV top squark (t~ -> dbar dbar)", "kind": "sample"}, "rows": 60, "error": null, "seconds": 0.193}, {"round": 2, "tool": "subjects_of", "args": {"predicate": "result_uses_sample", "object_set": "set_1"}, "rows": 97, "error": null, "seconds": 0.05}, {"round": 3, "tool