n-correlation interpretations** (from the result `hepkg:result:b5d7a4349aed174d446f3878`)\n8. **Inclusive and differential cross-sections for dilepton \\( t\\bar{t} \\) production measured in \\( \\sqrt{s}=13 \\) TeV \\( pp \\) collisions with the ATLAS detector** (from the result `hepkg:result:672f1e37310a4b762adc7a8c`)\n9. **Inclusive nonresonant multilepton probes of new phenomena at \\( \\sqrt{s}=13 \\, \\text{TeV} \\)** (from the result `hepkg:result:c2a8c6c321f85ca4e9620c78`)\n10. **Measurement of the associated production of a \\( \\mathup{Z} \\) boson with charm or bottom quark jets in proton-proton collisions at \\( \\sqrt{s}=13 \\) TeV** (from the result `hepkg:result:1724c3004deb2fe7c06e27d8`)\n11", "answered": true, "papers": ["2001.06899", "2004.01678", "2004.14060", "2006.05880", "2007.02873", "2008.05928", "2009.04363", "2010.14293", "2012.01581", "2012.03799", "2102.01444", "2103.04956", "2106.01676", "2107.12553", "2109.13808", "2112.00895", "2112.03161", "2201.11585", "2202.08676", "2205.05120", "2206.09466", "2207.00348", "2208.12095", "2209.07327", "2211.08028", "2302.05225", "2303.15340", "2307.01094", "2308.02285", "2309.14442", "2312.04450", "2402.08486", "2404.06204", "2408.03744", "2503.19420", "2506.13565", "2508.13900", "2509.22535", "2511.11853", "2604.27044"], "value": null, "steps": [{"round": 1, "tool": "search", "args": {"text": "Protos MC sample with heavy axigluon (CTEQ6L1 PDF)", "kind": "sample"}, "rows": 60, "error": null, "seconds": 0.277}, {"round": 2, "tool": "search", "args": {"text": "Protos MC sample with heavy axigluon (CTEQ6L1 PDF)", "kind": "sample"}, "rows": 60, "error": null, "seconds": 0.308}, {"round": 3, "tool": "subjects_of", "args": {"predicate": "result_uses_sample", "object_set": "set_2"}, "rows": 108, "error": null, "seconds": 0.057}], "sets": {"set_1": ["hepkg:sample:background-ttbar", "hepkg:sample:background-zjets", "hepkg:sample:bbh-signal-mc", "hepkg:sample:diboson", "hepkg:sample:diboson-mc", "hepkg:sample